&lt;p&gt; 09&sol;2004 - Made clerical&sol;technical edits&sol;clarifications with no substantive revisions and no changes to existing NCD policy. Effective date NA. Implementation Date 09&sol;10&sol;2004. (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;Regulations-and-Guidance&sol;Guidance&sol;Transmittals&sol;Downloads&sol;R21NCD.pdf&quot;&gt;TN 21&lt;&sol;a&gt;) (CR 3425)&lt;&sol;p&gt;

